menu "PicoCalc agent"
    config PICOCALC_AGENT_ENDPOINT
        string "Default Responses HTTPS endpoint (no credentials)"
        default "https://api.openai.com/v1/responses"
        help
            Used until an endpoint is provisioned with the serial net endpoint command.
            Wi-Fi networking is included only with CMake PICOCALC_AGENT_WIFI=ON.
            API keys and Wi-Fi passwords belong in NVS, never in this configuration.
endmenu
